unconstrained object.  The current evidence ranks the viable architectures:

```text
A. rank-two V_alpha / terminal monad L3-K2 skeleton
B. selected S3 / Green-Schwarz visible support
C. direct HYM or Route C solve as execution engine
```

The recommended construction is:

```text
